DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
30615::$$$message_0221_0000_0000$$$::I'm not afraid of my limbs crumbling.[lr]::
30616::$$$message_0221_0000_0001$$$::I'm only afraid of losing this fragment I so yearned for.[lr]::
30617::$$$message_0221_0000_0002$$$::I don't want to lose my light and go back to the monster I once was.[lr]::
30618::$$$message_0221_0000_0003$$$::Now...[lr]::
30619::$$$message_0221_0000_0004$$$::I'm going to make a wish come true, in exchange for her dream.::
30620::$$$message_0221_0001_0000$$$::I've returned to this place.[lr]::
30621::$$$message_0221_0001_0001$$$::There is nothing here.[lr]::
30622::$$$message_0221_0001_0002$$$::It is the outside of the world, where existence and even thought are not permitted.[lr]::
30623::$$$message_0221_0001_0003$$$::It's my infinite and thus infinitesimal, nostalgic home, where time and space don't exist.[lr]::
30624::$$$message_0221_0001_0004$$$::But...::
30625::$$$message_0221_0002_0000$$$::Now, there are something like coordinates here.[lr]::
30626::$$$message_0221_0002_0001$$$::It only stands to reason that a positional relationship has been created by my presence.[lr]::
30627::$$$message_0221_0002_0002$$$::Those coordinates connect to two points of light.[lr]::
30628::$$$message_0221_0002_0003$$$::That horizon exists, according to this entrance and exit to nothingness.::
30629::$$$message_0221_0003_0000$$$::"...Aaah."[lr]::
30630::$$$message_0221_0003_0001$$$::I move my feet.[lr]::
30631::$$$message_0221_0003_0002$$$::The sight before me pains my chest.[lr]::
30632::$$$message_0221_0003_0003$$$::What I should destroy.[lr]::
30633::$$$message_0221_0003_0004$$$::A one-time, miraculous mistake.::
30634::$$$message_0221_0004_0000$$$::A Holy Grail with one blank conclusion remaining.[lr]::
30635::$$$message_0221_0004_0001$$$::The last spectator stands in front of the crystallization of peaceful life, born from nothingness.[lr]::
30636::$$$message_0221_0004_0002$$$::A contractor of the Holy Grail.[lr]::
30637::$$$message_0221_0004_0003$$$::The one and only human sleeping here.[lr]::
30638::$$$message_0221_0004_0004$$$::She's my enemy with the same wish who desires a different outcome, and she's protecting this Holy Grail.::
30639::$$$message_0221_0005_0000$$$::"...Hey. This is our first time meeting like this. I'm glad you seem well."[lr]::
30640::$$$message_0221_0005_0001$$$::I raise my hand without approaching her.[lr]::
30641::$$$message_0221_0005_0002$$$::I can't get any closer.[lr]::
30642::$$$message_0221_0005_0003$$$::We've already parted ways, so there's a psychological distance between us...::
30643::$$$message_0221_0006_0000$$$::"Stop where you are, Avenger.[wvl canskip=0 time=800] I will kill you if you come any closer."[lr]::
30644::$$$message_0221_0006_0001$$$::...and also the physical problem of her killing me if I get any closer.::
30645::$$$message_0221_0007_0000$$$::"That would be a problem. I can't go back now that I've come here in this body.[lr]::
30646::$$$message_0221_0007_0001$$$::All we can do is have a staring contest, or get killed and go back down there."[lr]::
30647::$$$message_0221_0007_0002$$$::"Then I'll kill you here first. You've already been incorporated into my Holy Grail War.[lr]::
30648::$$$message_0221_0007_0003$$$::I'll do what I want. You can just stay there in that body and keep granting wishes."::
30649::$$$message_0221_0008_0000$$$::...Ah, so that's what she wants.[lr]::
30650::$$$message_0221_0008_0001$$$::She's suggesting that since she won't get involved with the victor of the Fifth Holy Grail War, I shouldn't get involved in her war, either.::
30651::$$$message_0221_0009_0000$$$::"Hmm. So it ends in killing either way. You've already died a bunch of times. Shouldn't you be worried that you might run out of resurrections?"::
30652::$$$message_0221_0010_0000$$$::"That won't happen. As long as this Holy Grail is blank, you can keep reviving.[lr]::
30653::$$$message_0221_0010_0001$$$::Unseen events and unknown knowledge are what drive you.[lr]::
30654::$$$message_0221_0010_0002$$$::If you return to the surface, this can continue forever as long you don't come back here again.[lr]::
30655::$$$message_0221_0010_0003$$$::...Yes, it can continue forever, so why..."::
30656::$$$message_0221_0011_0000$$$::Her reddish-brown eyes look frustrated.[lr]::
30657::$$$message_0221_0011_0001$$$::They say that she wants me to leave.[lr]::
30658::$$$message_0221_0011_0002$$$::They express her stubborn, hostile desire to fight me if I won't.::
30659::$$$message_0221_0012_0000$$$::"Well, I'm at a loss. You won't move unless we fight?"[lr]::
30660::$$$message_0221_0012_0001$$$::"Worry about yourself. Do I need to kill you once to make you understand?"[lr]::
30661::$$$message_0221_0012_0002$$$::"Damn, that's dirty. You know I can't fight you.[lr]::
30662::$$$message_0221_0012_0003$$$::I was going to make you use a Command Spell."::
30663::$$$message_0221_0013_0000$$$::"That sounds like you haven't given up.[lr]::
30664::$$$message_0221_0013_0001$$$::...Avenger, I don't understand the way you think.[lr]::
30665::$$$message_0221_0013_0002$$$::We can keep on living here, even if we have to repeat the same things over and over. It's exactly the reality we want.[lr]::
30666::$$$message_0221_0013_0003$$$::So why are you trying to kill yourself?"::
30667::$$$message_0221_0014_0000$$$::"...Speak for yourself. I was never anything to begin with. It doesn't matter whether I'm alive or dead."[lr]::
30668::$$$message_0221_0014_0001$$$::"I'm the same. You and I will disappear once this wish ends.[lr]::
30669::$$$message_0221_0014_0002$$$::...I don't want that. I don't want to die. I don't care about reality outside. You don't want to go back to nothingness either, do you!?"::
30670::$$$message_0221_0015_0000$$$::The Holy Grail rumbles.[lr]::
30671::$$$message_0221_0015_0001$$$::It's the impact of her emotions.[lr]::
30672::$$$message_0221_0015_0002$$$::   Half of this place has become hers.[lr]::
30673::$$$message_0221_0015_0003$$$::Even though I'm the power that drives the Holy Grail, she's got an edge over me. It's impossible for me to destroy the Holy Grail by force.::
30674::$$$message_0221_0016_0000$$$::There's only one way to stop this wish.[lr]::
30675::$$$message_0221_0016_0001$$$::She refuses to stop this, but she actually agrees with me.[lr]::
30676::$$$message_0221_0016_0002$$$::I need to wrap both of those up cleanly.::
30677::$$$message_0221_0017_0000$$$::"I'd like to keep this up a little longer, too. But I just don't feel right leaving mistakes unfixed.[lr]::
30678::$$$message_0221_0017_0001$$$::This wish is wrong, isn't it? That's why we have to stop it.[lr]::
30679::$$$message_0221_0017_0002$$$::Because I'm a champion of justice. I do what's right, and I value some rando more than myself."::
30680::$$$message_0221_0018_0000$$$::She stares at me in amazement.[lr]::
30681::$$$message_0221_0018_0001$$$::Can't say I blame her.[lr]::
30682::$$$message_0221_0018_0002$$$::"...I don't believe this. Are you insane?"[lr]::
30683::$$$message_0221_0018_0003$$$::"Hmm. I think I'm still pretty sane and serious about this. [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=1200 count=-3]Man, I must be some kinda monster."::
30684::$$$message_0221_0019_0000$$$::I shrug.[lr]::
30685::$$$message_0221_0019_0001$$$::But I can't help myself. That's the kind of person I've become, and how I've tried to live my life.[lr]::
30686::$$$message_0221_0019_0002$$$::I couldn't agree with it until the end, but after sticking to it for such a long time, I can accept it just this once.[lr]::
30687::$$$message_0221_0019_0003$$$::...Still, I'd prefer not to do that again.[lr]::
30688::$$$message_0221_0019_0004$$$::There doesn't need to be more than one person like that.::
30689::$$$message_0221_0020_0000$$$::"So, how about destroying the Holy Grail for me?[lr]::
30690::$$$message_0221_0020_0001$$$::Let's put an end to this selfish dream."[lr]::
30691::$$$message_0221_0020_0002$$$::"No.[lr]::
30692::$$$message_0221_0020_0003$$$::That's not what you really think. It isn't what the real you thinks.[lr]::
30693::$$$message_0221_0020_0004$$$::...Stop trying to show off.[lr]::
30694::$$$message_0221_0020_0005$$$::If you stop here... [wvl canskip=0 time=1000]The real you will never be saved!"::
30695::$$$message_0221_0021_0000$$$::                                 THaT'S riGHt. You WON'T bE SavED.[rf]::
30696::$$$message_0221_0022_0000$$$::"...There never was a real me.[lr]::
30697::$$$message_0221_0022_0001$$$::Fine. Then let me ask, why are you so obsessed with this wish?[lr]::
30698::$$$message_0221_0022_0002$$$::Is it because you'll be saved if you stay here?"[lr]::
30699::$$$message_0221_0022_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
30700::$$$message_0221_0022_0004$$$::She doesn't answer.[lr]::
30701::$$$message_0221_0022_0005$$$::Of course she doesn't. She wouldn't want salvation if she could answer that question right away.::
30702::$$$message_0221_0023_0000$$$::"...I-I do have a reason. As long as I stay here, I can still exist."[lr]::
30703::$$$message_0221_0023_0001$$$::"It just means you won't die. That isn't the same as being saved."[lr]::
30704::$$$message_0221_0023_0002$$$::"B-but...it's comfortable here. At least, compared to the outside, which is only suffering..."[lr]::
30705::$$$message_0221_0023_0003$$$::"That won't change. I've known you long enough. I know how clumsy you are. [l][say storage=eming14_anr_0121 name=アンリ]You're just going to keep suffering if you stay here."::
30706::$$$message_0221_0024_0000$$$::She doesn't trust herself.[lr]::
30707::$$$message_0221_0024_0001$$$::She feels guilty.[lr]::
30708::$$$message_0221_0024_0002$$$::She's proud at being better at one thing than anyone else, but she remains convinced that she won't accomplish anything with it.[lr]::
30709::$$$message_0221_0024_0003$$$::The more she trains...[lr]::
30710::$$$message_0221_0024_0004$$$::The harder she tries, the more people around her will give up on her.[lr]::
30711::$$$message_0221_0024_0005$$$::The feeling of failure has left an emotional scar on her that's lasted throughout her life.::
30712::$$$message_0221_0025_0000$$$::"But the only way is to keep trying. [l][say storage=eming14_anr_0131 name=アンリ]The disgrace of not trying will be even more unbearable to you than the shame of being alone.[lr]::
30713::$$$message_0221_0025_0001$$$::If you stop trying, the humiliation of being at the bottom despite being strong will torment you.[lr]::
30714::$$$message_0221_0025_0002$$$::You never managed to overcome that, even in here.[lr]::
30715::$$$message_0221_0025_0003$$$::Am I right? No matter how many times you won, no matter how many Masters you beat...[lr]::
30716::$$$message_0221_0025_0004$$$::...you never felt proud of yourself."::
30717::$$$message_0221_0026_0000$$$::"...That goes for you, too."[lr]::
30718::$$$message_0221_0026_0001$$$::All you do is hate.[lr]::
30719::$$$message_0221_0026_0002$$$::All you [font italic=true]can[font italic=false] do is devour those you love.::
30720::$$$message_0221_0027_0000$$$::"Let me just say that it's impossible no matter where you are. You'll never get rid of that miserable feeling. It's something people have to deal with their whole lives.[lr]::
30721::$$$message_0221_0027_0001$$$::You were just unlucky that you met someone you could leave that burden with."[lr]::
30722::$$$message_0221_0027_0002$$$::She really has terrible luck with men.[lr]::
30723::$$$message_0221_0027_0003$$$::The priest was a mirror who took people's burdens and dealt back twice as much.[lr]::
30724::$$$message_0221_0027_0004$$$::It wasn't his fault.[lr]::
30725::$$$message_0221_0027_0005$$$::Bazett's weakness that led her to trust him with her burdens is what defeated her.::
30726::$$$message_0221_0028_0000$$$::"No one else can take that burden for you. You have to bear it yourself. [l][say storage=eming14_anr_0151 name=アンリ]People can't support each other with their baggage. They can only do it with the bodies that struggle under that baggage."[lr]::
30727::$$$message_0221_0028_0001$$$::And even more unluckily, she was obsessed with training herself to bear everything on her own.[lr]::
30728::$$$message_0221_0028_0002$$$::That's why she never experienced failure.[lr]::
30729::$$$message_0221_0028_0003$$$::She mistook anguish for something that can be supported by someone else.::
30730::$$$message_0221_0029_0000$$$::"No one else can understand your anguish. That's true whether you're out there or in here.[lr]::
30731::$$$message_0221_0029_0001$$$::Listen to me. There's no salvation here, just suffering.[lr]::
30732::$$$message_0221_0029_0002$$$::Wake up, Master. Are you going to suffer here forever in exchange for never dying?"::
30733::$$$message_0221_0030_0000$$$::"...Ha. Then, what?[lr]::
30734::$$$message_0221_0030_0001$$$::Should I just live like a loser for the rest of my life?"[lr]::
30735::$$$message_0221_0030_0002$$$::"Not [font italic=true]like[font italic=false] a loser. That's what you are.[lr]::
30736::$$$message_0221_0030_0003$$$::You got stabbed in the back, so you locked yourself in here. As long as you can't let go of that, it'll nag at you forever."::
30737::$$$message_0221_0031_0000$$$::"Aarrgh, enough! You traitor! Traitor! Traitor![lr]::
30738::$$$message_0221_0031_0001$$$::This is your wish, right!? So you shouldn't care whether I suffer or not![lr]::
30739::$$$message_0221_0031_0002$$$::Outside, inside, it's all the same to me..."::
30740::$$$message_0221_0032_0000$$$::All the same, she says.[lr]::
30741::$$$message_0221_0032_0001$$$::She said that living is difficult.::
30742::$$$message_0221_0033_0000$$$::"Not true.[lr]::
30743::$$$message_0221_0033_0001$$$::You've known your entire life how hard living is."::
30744::$$$message_0221_0034_0000$$$::What I supported was her state of being.[lr]::
30745::$$$message_0221_0034_0001$$$::This woman is weak. Her abilities are nothing to sneeze at, but her existence was too weak. It was her critical flaw that made me wonder how she even lived.[lr]::
30746::$$$message_0221_0034_0002$$$::Her mental state is so fragile that I have no doubt it could lead her to death anytime, even now.[lr]::
30747::$$$message_0221_0034_0003$$$::She's so pessimistic that she might slit her wrists at any moment.[lr]::
30748::$$$message_0221_0034_0004$$$::But...::
30749::$$$message_0221_0035_0000$$$::"But you made it this far, didn't you?[lr]::
30750::$$$message_0221_0035_0001$$$::You're clumsy and embarrassing...[lr]::
30751::$$$message_0221_0035_0002$$$::...but you still tried to be a better version of yourself."[lr]::
30752::$$$message_0221_0035_0003$$$::She struggled to better herself in spite of her weakness.[lr]::
30753::$$$message_0221_0035_0004$$$::Even now, she's still breathing while suffering.[lr]::
30754::$$$message_0221_0035_0005$$$::That pride...[lr]::
30755::$$$message_0221_0035_0006$$$::If you don't acknowledge it, then who will?::
30756::$$$message_0221_0036_0000$$$::"...Stop it. I've had enough of your lofty opinions. Don't say arrogant things while pretending not to notice who you are![lr]::
30757::$$$message_0221_0036_0001$$$::You can't even see anything about me. Your eyes don't see anything at all!"[lr]::
30758::$$$message_0221_0036_0002$$$::She shakes her head.[lr]::
30759::$$$message_0221_0036_0003$$$::She refuses to abandon her wish.[lr]::
30760::$$$message_0221_0036_0004$$$::She's throwing a childish tantrum, thinking that if she loses this argument, then everything will truly end.::
30761::$$$message_0221_0037_0000$$$::"Not just your eyes. You can't even see yourself.[r]::
30762::$$$message_0221_0037_0001$$$::I don't want to die, either. But your regrets are nothing compared to mine.[lr]::
30763::$$$message_0221_0037_0002$$$::You wanted to keep enjoying life. You didn't want to fill in any gaps. All because you knew you'd go back to being nothing.[lr]::
30764::$$$message_0221_0037_0003$$$::And yet you kept repeating the days because..."::
30765::$$$message_0221_0038_0000$$$::She just doesn't get it.[lr]::
30766::$$$message_0221_0038_0001$$$::I got bored of that.::
30767::$$$message_0221_0039_0000$$$::"I can't see myself? Are you even looking at me?"[lr]::
30768::$$$message_0221_0039_0001$$$::"...All I see is a shadow. You're turning into nothing."[lr]::
30769::$$$message_0221_0039_0002$$$::"Yeah. That's correct. Don't get the wrong idea, Master.[lr]::
30770::$$$message_0221_0039_0003$$$::This body, this character was born from wearing Shirou Emiya's shell. My original self is nothing. I have no attachments or regrets. I never had any thoughts to begin with, so there's nothing I would do."::
30771::$$$message_0221_0040_0000$$$::That's why I don't feel anything about returning to the void.::
30772::$$$message_0221_0041_0000$$$::"...Lies. [cacheimage storage=バゼット05b(中),逆月04b][wvl canskip=0 time=800][clfg][fg index=2000 pos=c storage=バゼット05b(中)][fg left=0 index=1000 top=0 storage=逆月04b][dash page=back textoff=0 mx=140 opacity=255 layer=all irot=-0.0 cx=126 imag=1.4 time=500 cy=271 mag=1.4 my=0 rot=-0.0 accel=3][fadein textoff=0 time=300 storage=逆月04b noclear=1]Lies, lies, lies![lr]::
30773::$$$message_0221_0041_0001$$$::You won't trick me! [wvl][shock vmax=15 time=300 count=-3]I won't abandon you![lr]::
30774::$$$message_0221_0041_0002$$$::Keep granting my wish, Avenger![lr]::
30775::$$$message_0221_0041_0003$$$::It's fine if you're bored. It's fine even if nothing new happens. If you tell me to fight the war alone, then I will![lr]::
30776::$$$message_0221_0041_0004$$$::There are still gaps left, aren't there? It's okay then. No matter how small, as long as we can still see them..."::
30777::$$$message_0221_0042_0000$$$::She wants the world to keep turning.[lr]::
30778::$$$message_0221_0042_0001$$$::She wants those golden days to go on.[lr]::
30779::$$$message_0221_0042_0002$$$::The things I couldn't obtain yet should have been given to me...[rf]::
30780::$$$message_0221_0043_0000$$$::"...Persistent, aren't you.[lr]::
30781::$$$message_0221_0043_0001$$$::Sorry, but I can't grant that wish. All that meaningless time ends here."[lr]::
30782::$$$message_0221_0043_0002$$$::I take a step forward.[lr]::
30783::$$$message_0221_0043_0003$$$::...What a joke. In the end, Bazett doesn't even try to stop me.[lr]::
30784::$$$message_0221_0043_0004$$$::She was only that angry because...::
30785::$$$message_0221_0044_0000$$$::"...Stop. You're going, even though you'll just turn back into a corpse? Even though you can have as many good times as you want in here?"[lr]::
30786::$$$message_0221_0044_0001$$$::She kept the wish going because of this flawed notion.[lr]::
30787::$$$message_0221_0044_0002$$$::If I'd just said yes before, then this all would have broken a long time ago.::
30788::$$$message_0221_0045_0000$$$::"You didn't enjoy it?[lr]::
30789::$$$message_0221_0045_0001$$$::I did. It was hard, but still..."[lr]::
30790::$$$message_0221_0045_0002$$$::Then the rest is simple.[lr]::
30791::$$$message_0221_0045_0003$$$::I got bored of it a long time ago, so I just need to state the conclusion.::
30792::$$$message_0221_0046_0000$$$::"...In the end, living made me happy.[lr]::
30793::$$$message_0221_0046_0001$$$::There's no way you want to go back to that void... This isn't my wish at all.[lr]::
30794::$$$message_0221_0046_0002$$$::Aŋra Mainiiu. This world was your dream.[lr]::
30795::$$$message_0221_0046_0003$$$::If my wish was to continue the Holy Grail War, then those peaceful days were..."::
30796::$$$message_0221_0047_0000$$$::   A dream that's already passed.[lr]::
30797::$$$message_0221_0047_0001$$$::I won't continue this, no matter how fun it was. Not once it's all filled in.::
30798::$$$message_0221_0048_0000$$$::"Yeah. But I'm bored of most of it now."[lr]::
30799::$$$message_0221_0048_0001$$$::In order to see something new...[lr]::
30800::$$$message_0221_0048_0002$$$::"So I want to see how this ends."::
30801::$$$message_0221_0049_0000$$$::"Aaaah..."[lr]::
30802::$$$message_0221_0049_0001$$$::Something that was clinging to me vanishes.[lr]::
30803::$$$message_0221_0049_0002$$$::Unfortunately, I don't know what face she's making.::
30804::$$$message_0221_0050_0000$$$::"You're truly..."[lr]::
30805::$$$message_0221_0050_0001$$$::"Give it up, Master. It's going to vanish without a trace. No matter how badly you or I want it, this world is over."[lr]::
30806::$$$message_0221_0050_0002$$$::"Why," I hear her whisper.[lr]::
30807::$$$message_0221_0050_0003$$$::...Hmm. I've already explained at length, so why's she asking again?::
30808::$$$message_0221_0051_0000$$$::"It's gonna collapse. It's complete, so the only thing left is for it to break. Once it's all gone, then we'll both disappear, too."[lr]::
30809::$$$message_0221_0051_0001$$$::"But why? It'll just go back to 0, right? If there's a void, then you can come back[line len=2]"[lr]::
30810::$$$message_0221_0051_0002$$$::"That's only if [font italic=true]1[font italic=false] exists. Nothing can come out of true nothingness. 1 comes from the gap we call 0. [l][say storage=eming14_anr_0281 name=アンリ]But 0 can't become anything without 1."::
30811::$$$message_0221_0052_0000$$$::And the concept of 1 doesn't exist within me.[lr]::
30812::$$$message_0221_0052_0001$$$::Everything uses nothingness to change.[lr]::
30813::$$$message_0221_0052_0002$$$::But nothingness can never interact with those new events.::
30814::$$$message_0221_0053_0000$$$::"...I see. So this really is the end. I didn't learn anything, even after I experienced so much."[lr]::
30815::$$$message_0221_0053_0001$$$::Her voice is calm.[lr]::
30816::$$$message_0221_0053_0002$$$::There's a hint of fear in it, but it's the conviction of someone who's too prepared to die.::
30817::$$$message_0221_0054_0000$$$::"That's your task for next time.[lr]::
30818::$$$message_0221_0054_0001$$$::Well, it was always an illusion. There won't be any tangible spoils left."[lr]::
30819::$$$message_0221_0054_0002$$$::...Ah.[lr]::
30820::$$$message_0221_0054_0003$$$::I suppose I could leave [font italic=true]that[font italic=false].[lr]::
30821::$$$message_0221_0054_0004$$$::I'm a Servant that's existed for half a year. I can at least make the time for it.::
30822::$$$message_0221_0055_0000$$$::"...Avenger?"[lr]::
30823::$$$message_0221_0055_0001$$$::"Just talking to myself. So what's going on with the Holy Grail?"[lr]::
30824::$$$message_0221_0055_0002$$$::"...It won't last much longer. There's already cracks in it."[lr]::
30825::$$$message_0221_0055_0003$$$::I see.[lr]::
30826::$$$message_0221_0055_0004$$$::Then this body should be good enough.::
30827::$$$message_0221_0056_0000$$$::"...Damn monster. You're insane."[lr]::
30828::$$$message_0221_0056_0001$$$::...I saw a foolish man's dreams, just once.[lr]::
30829::$$$message_0221_0056_0002$$$::Unfortunately, his way of life makes me sick. But I am grateful that I got to become such a twisted person.[lr]::
30830::$$$message_0221_0056_0003$$$::His existence was the complete opposite of mine.[lr]::
30831::$$$message_0221_0056_0004$$$::He took the shape of an ideal that everyone dreams of but eventually abandons once they realize how evil its hypocrisy is.[lr]::
30832::$$$message_0221_0056_0005$$$::I must have longed to be that honest to a fault, at least once.::
30833::$$$message_0221_0057_0000$$$::"...All right. It's time to go back to where we belong, Master.[lr]::
30834::$$$message_0221_0057_0001$$$::That's what I made this for. We need to make sure it's completely gone."[lr]::
30835::$$$message_0221_0057_0002$$$::"...Avenger. You say we're going back, but what should I do?[lr]::
30836::$$$message_0221_0057_0003$$$::Am I going to disappear along with you and the Holy Grail?"::
30837::$$$message_0221_0058_0000$$$::"You don't have to go that far.[lr]::
30838::$$$message_0221_0058_0001$$$::Look, you're going that way, to the entrance. I'm going the other way, to the exit. We're never going to see each other again."[lr]::
30839::$$$message_0221_0058_0002$$$::I point to the horizon.[lr]::
30840::$$$message_0221_0058_0003$$$::The entrance is the world after this one: the fifth day.[lr]::
30841::$$$message_0221_0058_0004$$$::The exit is the world before this one: nothingness.::
30842::$$$message_0221_0059_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
30843::$$$message_0221_0059_0001$$$::Bazett is surprised. She asks why.[lr]::
30844::$$$message_0221_0059_0002$$$::Even though she should already know.::
30845::$$$message_0221_0060_0000$$$::"Because you're alive.[lr]::
30846::$$$message_0221_0060_0001$$$::Someone who isn't dead can't go to the other side."[lr]::
30847::$$$message_0221_0060_0002$$$::I hear her gasping.[lr]::
30848::$$$message_0221_0060_0003$$$::I guess it's a hard pill to swallow being told all of a sudden.::
30849::$$$message_0221_0061_0000$$$::"Wait a second. I thought I was..."[lr]::
30850::$$$message_0221_0061_0001$$$::"You aren't dead. Your wish was 'I don't want to die.' All I did was grant it.[lr]::
30851::$$$message_0221_0061_0002$$$::You were in a near-death state back then, but it wasn't fatal. I've preserved you in that state for half a year."[lr]::
30852::$$$message_0221_0061_0003$$$::"...Ah..."::
30853::$$$message_0221_0062_0000$$$::The problem is what happened after. [lr]::
30854::$$$message_0221_0062_0001$$$::The woman from the church found Bazett's hideout and mercifully treated her, which complicated things.[lr]::
30855::$$$message_0221_0062_0002$$$::If only she hadn't come, it wouldn't have gone on much longer.[lr]::
30856::$$$message_0221_0062_0003$$$::Regardless, Bazett's body was apparently at its limit. If she hadn't found Bazett, then these four days would have abruptly ended one day.[lr]::
30857::$$$message_0221_0062_0004$$$::Even with me providing life support, Bazett's body might not have lasted past half a year in a near-death state.::
30858::$$$message_0221_0063_0000$$$::"B-but...!"[lr]::
30859::$$$message_0221_0063_0001$$$::"Did you know that only the living can bring the dead back to life? If you were dead, then you couldn't have called for me that's also dead to begin with."::
30860::$$$message_0221_0064_0000$$$::That's right.[lr]::
30861::$$$message_0221_0064_0001$$$::The dead can't grant anything. Only the breath of the living can make things happen.[lr]::
30862::$$$message_0221_0064_0002$$$::Even if a dead person is granted a second life, the dead can never raise the dead.[lr]::
30863::$$$message_0221_0064_0003$$$::Didn't we talk about that back at the beginning?[lr]::
30864::$$$message_0221_0064_0004$$$::Only the living get to call for miracles.::
30865::$$$message_0221_0065_0000$$$::...I hear a sound.[lr]::
30866::$$$message_0221_0065_0001$$$::Considering it could've bowed out months ago, I'm impressed this place has held out this long.::
30867::$$$message_0221_0066_0000$$$::"Hurry. The path won't stay open forever. It's almost dawn outside as well. If you can get past there, you'll find the fifth day you wanted so badly."[lr]::
30868::$$$message_0221_0066_0001$$$::"B-but what about you?"[lr]::
30869::$$$message_0221_0066_0002$$$::"It's all right. Just go. You told me to make my own wish come true, remember?[lr]::
30870::$$$message_0221_0066_0003$$$::So don't stop. My wish won't come true if you stay here."[lr]::
30871::$$$message_0221_0066_0004$$$::That's the only thing I wished for.[lr]::
30872::$$$message_0221_0066_0005$$$::It's such an insipid sentiment.::
30873::$$$message_0221_0067_0000$$$::"...I can't. What am I supposed to do after being told I'm alive all of a sudden?[lr]::
30874::$$$message_0221_0067_0001$$$::You're the one who said the outside and inside are the same. Even if I go back to the real world, I..."[lr]::
30875::$$$message_0221_0067_0002$$$::"You'll make it work, like you always have. I've given you a hard time, but I don't have any complaints with the way you live. Just keep living as nervously as you always have."[lr]::
30876::$$$message_0221_0067_0003$$$::"Wha..."::
30877::$$$message_0221_0068_0000$$$::"That dumb priest said it, too. If you get stuck, cross the ocean. [l][say storage=eming14_anr_0401 name=アンリ]He was right.[lr]::
30878::$$$message_0221_0068_0001$$$::...Bazett, the world is still moving on.[lr]::
30879::$$$message_0221_0068_0002$$$::It might be writhing in agony on its deathbed, but it's still alive.[lr]::
30880::$$$message_0221_0068_0003$$$::Are you really going to laugh that off as hopeless?"::
30881::$$$message_0221_0069_0000$$$::It would be hilarious if the parasites gave up while the host was still alive and kicking.[lr]::
30882::$$$message_0221_0069_0001$$$::If the world's still got life in it, then there's plenty we can still do.[lr]::
30883::$$$message_0221_0069_0002$$$::It doesn't matter if it's good or evil, possible or impossible.[lr]::
30884::$$$message_0221_0069_0003$$$::That isn't something the creatures living now can judge, anyway.[lr]::
30885::$$$message_0221_0069_0004$$$::All life struggles for no clear reward, in the hopes that[lr]::
30886::$$$message_0221_0069_0005$$$::those who come after will recognize our value.::
30887::$$$message_0221_0070_0000$$$::"...It's not fair. I don't know what to say to you after that."[lr]::
30888::$$$message_0221_0070_0001$$$::"Just think of it as a grudge. I'm a lying devil, so I like to beguile people with sweet nothings."[lr]::
30889::$$$message_0221_0070_0002$$$::I grin.[lr]::
30890::$$$message_0221_0070_0003$$$::I'm just a silhouette now, but I hope she can see it.::
30891::$$$message_0221_0071_0000$$$::"...I never knew that. You were a devil all this time, huh?"[lr]::
30892::$$$message_0221_0071_0001$$$::A hint of vigor is back in her voice.[lr]::
30893::$$$message_0221_0071_0002$$$::"Excuse [font italic=true]you[font italic=false]. Aŋra Mainiiu is a big shot."[lr]::
30894::$$$message_0221_0071_0003$$$::"True, but you don't seem like one to me at all."[lr]::
30895::$$$message_0221_0071_0004$$$::I hear her bitter laugh.[lr]::
30896::$$$message_0221_0071_0005$$$::...For such a crybaby, she sure is good at the comebacks.[lr]::
30897::$$$message_0221_0071_0006$$$::My beautiful Master must be looking at the distant entrance by now.::
30898::$$$message_0221_0072_0000$$$::"But I believe you now. Your advice to go back outside can't be anything but honeyed words.[lr]::
30899::$$$message_0221_0072_0001$$$::You're just telling me to keep suffering."[lr]::
30900::$$$message_0221_0072_0002$$$::"Bingo. I was keeping this a secret, but I actually love watching you struggle."[lr]::
30901::$$$message_0221_0072_0003$$$::"Pft. Well, well. My Servant is terrible at keeping secrets."::
30902::$$$message_0221_0073_0000$$$::...This is the best farewell I could've hoped for.[lr]::
30903::$$$message_0221_0073_0001$$$::It appears that I've grown fond of our relationship.[lr]::
30904::$$$message_0221_0073_0002$$$::I'm sure that's why I stuck with her this long without violating or killing her.[lr]::
30905::$$$message_0221_0073_0003$$$::This is the final parting that I've hoped for: [lr]::
30906::$$$message_0221_0073_0004$$$::to go our separate ways with our relationship intact.[lr]::
30907::$$$message_0221_0073_0005$$$::If there's one thing we haven't done, it is fighting with our backs to each other until the very end.::
30908::$$$message_0221_0074_0000$$$::"Well, chat's over. You don't have to go, but I'm leaving first."[lr]::
30909::$$$message_0221_0074_0001$$$::"Don't worry. I won't stop.[lr]::
30910::$$$message_0221_0074_0002$$$::...But before that, I want to ask you something. It's a serious question, so I want a serious answer."::
30911::$$$message_0221_0075_0000$$$::Her voice is tense.[lr]::
30912::$$$message_0221_0075_0001$$$::I wonder what she could still be holding back after all this time...[lr]::
30913::$$$message_0221_0075_0002$$$::"...Why? Why did you choose me, when I have nothing going for me?[lr]::
30914::$$$message_0221_0075_0003$$$::I'm a weak and boring person, like you said."[lr]::
30915::$$$message_0221_0075_0004$$$::...And sure enough, it's one embarrassing question.::
30916::$$$message_0221_0076_0000$$$::"...I'm not really sure. But I'm fine with that. What I like is your weakness.[lr]::
30917::$$$message_0221_0076_0001$$$::You dislike yourself and never managed to love yourself, and you knew that, but you still struggled to be the best version of yourself. [lr]::
30918::$$$message_0221_0076_0002$$$::I like clumsy people like that. [l][say storage=eming14_anr_0453 name=アンリ]I just like people who try for their own sake, no matter where they end up."::
30919::$$$message_0221_0077_0000$$$::"Not...for someone else's sake?"[lr]::
30920::$$$message_0221_0077_0001$$$::"Yeah. You can just leave that to the people who have the time for it.[lr]::
30921::$$$message_0221_0077_0002$$$::You just need to be a little more aware of how full your hands already are. Because you're an idiot."::
30922::$$$message_0221_0078_0000$$$::"Mgh..."[lr]::
30923::$$$message_0221_0078_0001$$$::I hear her grunt.[lr]::
30924::$$$message_0221_0078_0002$$$::I can't tell if she's stifling her anger or a laugh.::
30925::$$$message_0221_0079_0000$$$::"...I see. You're saying that you saved me because I don't matter."[lr]::
30926::$$$message_0221_0079_0001$$$::   Yeah.[lr]::
30927::$$$message_0221_0079_0002$$$::It's because you're so ordinary and weak[line len=2][l]To me, that's an irreplaceable brilliance.::
30928::$$$message_0221_0080_0000$$$::"...I understand. Let's say you were just satisfying your own whims."[lr]::
30929::$$$message_0221_0080_0001$$$::"Works for me. Well, let's say goodbye now."[lr]::
30930::$$$message_0221_0080_0002$$$::"Yes. We should walk away with our backs to each other... I feel like I might slap you if I saw your face now."[lr]::
30931::$$$message_0221_0080_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
30932::$$$message_0221_0080_0004$$$::She sounds cheerful.[lr]::
30933::$$$message_0221_0080_0005$$$::At the last possible moment, I've completed something I couldn't accomplish.::
30934::$$$message_0221_0081_0000$$$::"...Will it work? Do I even have a back anymore?"[lr]::
30935::$$$message_0221_0081_0001$$$::"You do. Come on, turn around."[lr]::
30936::$$$message_0221_0081_0002$$$::I turn my back on her.[lr]::
30937::$$$message_0221_0081_0003$$$::I can't feel her touch, but I can tell she's behind me.[lr]::
30938::$$$message_0221_0081_0004$$$::It isn't warm or anything, but my ability to feel happiness is still working.::
30939::$$$message_0221_0082_0000$$$::"You're right. Okay, let's go."[lr]::
30940::$$$message_0221_0082_0001$$$::"So impatient. We should start at the same time. We'll count down from three, and then we run."[lr]::
30941::$$$message_0221_0082_0002$$$::Like sprinters.[lr]::
30942::$$$message_0221_0082_0003$$$::We each imagine the countdown in our heads.::
30943::$$$message_0221_0083_0000$$$::3, take a deep breath.[lr]::
30944::$$$message_0221_0083_0001$$$::"Oh, and no starting early on two. This isn't a competition after all."[lr]::
30945::$$$message_0221_0083_0002$$$::2, her Bazett-like worry makes me feel better.[lr]::
30946::$$$message_0221_0083_0003$$$::"Ahaha. What a noob. I would've run on the first count. I'd be gone by the time they wait three seconds."[lr]::
30947::$$$message_0221_0083_0004$$$::1, I give her a comeback, like always.[lr]::
30948::$$$message_0221_0083_0005$$$::"Yes. And I'd shoot you in the back after three seconds."[lr]::
30949::$$$message_0221_0083_0006$$$::She laughs loudly.[lr]::
30950::$$$message_0221_0083_0007$$$::Zero.::
30951::$$$message_0221_0084_0000$$$::[block len=1][block len=1] vision turns to nothing.[lr]::
30952::$$$message_0221_0084_0001$$$::There's no trace of the happiness at [block len=1][block len=1] back.[lr]::
30953::$$$message_0221_0084_0002$$$::[block len=1] hear the sound of something collapsing.[lr]::
30954::$$$message_0221_0084_0003$$$::That sound will become nothing soon, as well.::
30955::$$$message_0221_0085_0000$$$::[block len=1] run. Just at an average pace. [block len=1] am in no real rush.[lr]::
30956::$$$message_0221_0085_0001$$$::The [block len=1][block len=1] from a few hours ago might have felt the wind, but now, [block len=1] can't learn any external information anymore.[lr]::
30957::$$$message_0221_0085_0002$$$::[block len=1] will lose these thoughts eventually, too.[lr]::
30958::$$$message_0221_0085_0003$$$::[block len=1] just barely manage to feel vibrations that must be the sound of collapsing.[lr]::
30959::$$$message_0221_0085_0004$$$::Meaning that this sound must be coming from within [block len=1][block len=1].::
30960::$$$message_0221_0086_0000$$$::[block len=1] run. The exit should be that way.[lr]::
30961::$$$message_0221_0086_0001$$$::[block len=1] should've made sure of it while [block len=1] could still see.[lr]::
30962::$$$message_0221_0086_0002$$$::In the sound of fragments falling all around, [block len=1] hear a stir that [block len=1] have experienced before.[lr]::
30963::$$$message_0221_0086_0003$$$::[block len=1][block len=1] legs nearly stop, but [block len=1] keep them moving.[lr]::
30964::$$$message_0221_0086_0004$$$::In the sound of blooming life, [block len=1] see the sunshine of the past.[lr]::
30965::$$$message_0221_0086_0005$$$::[block len=1][block len=1] legs nearly stop, but [block len=1] keep them moving.::
30966::$$$message_0221_0087_0000$$$::[block len=1] head for the exit.[lr]::
30967::$$$message_0221_0087_0001$$$::[block len=1] run through the fragments of everyday life, which [block len=1] long for more than [block len=1][block len=1] own disappearance, with eyes that can no longer see.::
30968::$$$message_0221_0088_0000$$$::...[block len=1] just wanted to see something new.[lr]::
30969::$$$message_0221_0088_0001$$$::Just as [block len=1][block len=1] old personality wished for her resurrection, [block len=1] wanted to know as much of a peaceful life as [block len=1] could.[lr]::
30970::$$$message_0221_0088_0002$$$::Even if it meant turning [block len=1][block len=1][block len=1][block len=1][block len=1][block len=1] back into [block len=1][block len=1].[lr]::
30971::$$$message_0221_0088_0003$$$::[block len=1] sought out light one second later, knowing that death would come in ten seconds.::
30972::$$$message_0221_0089_0000$$$::[block len=1] run.[lr]::
30973::$$$message_0221_0089_0001$$$::There's no distance in this void.[lr]::
30974::$$$message_0221_0089_0002$$$::If [block len=1] can't reach it even if [block len=1] try running there, then it means it's a place [block len=1] can never reach.[lr]::
30975::$$$message_0221_0089_0003$$$::The light, the exit [block len=1] saw back then, disappeared as soon as [block len=1][block len=1] vision returned to nothingness.[lr]::
30976::$$$message_0221_0089_0004$$$::There's nowhere for [block len=1][block len=1] to go, now that [block len=1] have returned to nothingness.::
30977::$$$message_0221_0090_0000$$$::                                                      Ah, but still…::
30978::$$$message_0221_0091_0000$$$::                            [block len=1] feel something [wait canskip=0 time=1000]bright through these eyelids.::
30979::$$$message_0221_0092_0000$$$::[block len=1] keep going, even as [block len=1] crumble.[lr]::
30980::$$$message_0221_0092_0001$$$::[block len=1][block len=1] gratitude and joy for the time spent.[lr]::
30981::$$$message_0221_0092_0002$$$::[block len=1][block len=1] farewell to those [block len=1] was with.[lr]::
30982::$$$message_0221_0092_0003$$$::...[block len=1] am glad for everything that happened.[lr]::
30983::$$$message_0221_0092_0004$$$::It seems that there's an exit, even for [block len=1][block len=1].::
30984::$$$message_0221_0093_0000$$$::[block len=1][block len=1] old personality boasted that ending is different from not continuing.[lr]::
30985::$$$message_0221_0093_0001$$$::To borrow those hopeful words, [block len=1][block len=1] end might lead to a continuation.::
30986::$$$message_0221_0094_0000$$$::Rather than remaining here for eternity,[lr]::
30987::$$$message_0221_0094_0001$$$::[block len=1] will aim for whatever's next, even if [block len=1] disappear.[lr]::
30988::$$$message_0221_0094_0002$$$::To do that, [block len=1] filled [block len=1][block len=1][block len=1][block len=1][block len=1][block len=1] in to create a picture.[lr]::
30989::$$$message_0221_0094_0003$$$::To do that, [block len=1] will return to [block len=1][block len=1][block len=1][block len=1][block len=1][block len=1] and create a picture of the world.[lr]::
30990::$$$message_0221_0094_0004$$$::[block len=1] may not be able to see that picture anymore,[lr]::
30991::$$$message_0221_0094_0005$$$::but [block len=1] hope that someone else finds it beautiful.::
30992::$$$message_0221_0095_0000$$$::[block len=1] run. [block len=1] run. [block len=1] run.[lr]::
30993::$$$message_0221_0095_0001$$$::The stars are bright. [l][block len=1][block len=1] guide is true.[l][block len=1][block len=1] shredded body moves by sheer willpower.[lr]::
30994::$$$message_0221_0095_0002$$$::It's all right. [block len=1] am sure to reach it.[lr]::
30995::$$$message_0221_0095_0003$$$::Even if the dream stops and the light is lost...[lr]::
30996::$$$message_0221_0095_0004$$$::...[block len=1][block len=1] eyes can feel the brightness.::
30997::$$$message_0221_0096_0000$$$::                                 Lastly, [block len=1] say a farewell to [block len=1][block len=1][block len=1][block len=1][block len=1][block len=1].::
30998::$$$message_0221_0097_0000$$$::   Now, let's go see the continuation of the end.[lr]::
30999::$$$message_0221_0097_0001$$$::[block len=1] know it's just [block len=1][block len=1] imagination and where [block len=1] am headed isn't a great place, [wait canskip=false time=1000]but for now, [wait canskip=false time=1000][block len=1] walk toward where it feels bright...[nolr][p]::
930635::$$$message_9221_0004_0001$$$::The last spectator stands in front of the crystallization of peaceful life, born from nothingness.[r]::

